An alternative way is to polymorph into a demon or undead monster. They
are immune to the touch of death. Undeads are additionally immune to the
touch of Death (Death's attack). Non-chaotic gods frown upon players who
pray while polymorphed into such a monster, but your priest is chaotic.

The usual monster for that is the Vampire Lord. As additional bonus, you
will get regeneration and slow digestion(*), flying, magical breathing
and 12 extra points of AC. On the flip side, maximum HP as a monster is
low, and you will need your neck to wear an amulet of unchanging if you
want the polymorph to be permanent. Also, without MR you have to fear
armor-destroying attacks from liches and golden nagas, and the attacks
from angels in the late game can become troublesome.

By the way, arch-liches can cast touch of death. You'd better genocide
the whole lot of them anyway.


